 "offers_raw": {
  "lunch": "No lunch buffet found in any snippet. DoorDash shows a 'Lunch Box' menu section; contents and price are not known. DoorDash also lists a 'Biryani's Combo Offer' marked Tuesday and Wednesday only. Meltivers (a third-party promotions page) lists a 'Wednesday Special Offer: Any 3 Biryanis $25.99'; it was seen in one snippet and the price was not cross-checked. Lunch service hours in data/business.json are 11:00 AM to 2:30 PM (3:00 PM Fri to Sun), not verified. No thali or lunch-combo pricing was found.",
  "catering": "The official site has a catering page (currydistrict.net/catering.html); its content could not be read. Sulekha describes outdoor catering for special occasions plus pre-booked advance platters for large groups, customised to the client's taste, for baby showers, corporate events, surprise parties, housewarmings and birthdays. No party-tray sizes or prices were found. Sulekha gives (469) 200-5944 as the contact number. The family packs (see Rice) and the Weekend Family Pack are the only priced group-size items found.",
  "happyHour": "Weekdays 4 to 7 PM, per the Atly listing (same as data/business.json). What is discounted was NOT found. Caution: dinner service in business.json resumes at 4:30 PM, so a 4 PM start looks inconsistent; treat the window as unverified. One snippet also says you can bring your own beer on weekends (unverified, low confidence). Do not show any happy-hour discount or alcohol claim.",
  "kids": "No kids menu found.",
  "delivery": "Delivery and pickup: Uber Eats, DoorDash (with a Caviar mirror and a legacy Postmates link) and Clover online ordering (curry-district-little-elm.cloveronline.com). The official site has a 'Door Delivery' page (currydistrict.net/doordelivery.html) that could not be read. Minimum order, delivery fee and service fee were not found. Delivery-app prices appear to run higher than the aggregator menu prices (for example Garlic Naan $3.49 vs $3.75), but this is an inference. Gift cards are listed on Giftly (a third-party gift-card page).",
  "other": "Weekend Family Pack: weekend family-size biryani and pulav packs come with a free appetizer and dessert, chef's choice (official site: 'family pack options that include free appetizer and dessert'). DoorDash prices seen: Chicken 65 Biryani $47.79, Chicken Dum Biryani $47.79, Chicken 65 Pulav $42.99. The breakfast menu (Idly, Vada, Dosa, Puri) and the Indo-Chinese section are on the official site; not researched here. Possible sister location: the Instagram and Facebook handles say 'CurryDistrictFrisco', so some aggregator data (especially the conflicting dessert and lassi prices) may come from another location or an older menu."
